<title>FRANCE: Elf placed 10 pct in Geophysique.</title>
<headline>Elf placed 10 pct in Geophysique.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Aquitaine has placed a 10 percent stake in Compagnie Generale de Geophysique (CGG) on the share market, a company official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The placement concerns about 400,000 shares.</p>
<p>Market sources said the placement was made at a price of 365 francs per share by brokers Du Bouzet, part of BNP.</p>
<p>Market sources said Du Bouzet had started offering Geophysique shares late on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;With this operation, Elf has readjusted its interest in CGG to a level more in line with its management policy concerning financial interests,&quot; Elf said in a statement.</p>
</text>
